- **Unit (Vitest):** SKU grammar parser (SETTING/CONFIGURED/READY-MADE/STONE/PAIR, 100% on a golden corpus), pricing calculator (exact decimal math, versioned snapshots), compatibility engine (INV-01/02/03, DENY>ALLOW>UNKNOWN), order state machine (all legal + illegal transitions), discount validation, refund bounds, permission matrix (every role × module × action).
