- **E2E (Playwright) — the 14 journeys:** (1) visitor browse→PDP; (2) register→verify→sign-in; (3) search+filter real data; (4) add to cart + quantity update; (5) complete checkout through the test provider; (6) payment state correct; (7) view order + history; (8) DYO configuration→quote→review→add-to-cart; (9) 3D/AR eligibility honesty; (10) vendor upload→processing status; (11) vendor edit→submit→correct moderation state; (12) admin review→approve→publication follows rules; (13) unauthorized users blocked from protected routes/data; (14) duplicate requests/replayed payment events create no duplicates.
- Tests use isolated fixtures and explicitly isolated test data; never production data or production payment credentials; DB-gated suites skip gracefully (never fail) when no database is reachable.

