## 13. BUILD ORDER (follow sequentially; keep the app runnable after every step)

1. **Scaffold:** monorepo, workspace packages, config (env contract: `DATABASE_URL` single secret variable, `MAIHAN_ENV` local|preview|staging|production, optional `REDIS_URL`, optional `API_PORT`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, optional AI/email/PSP keys), design tokens + fonts + global CSS.
2. **Database:** full migration chain (§4.1) + schema-fidelity assertion (introspect the migrated schema and assert exact counts/names in CI) + reference seed (metals, jewellery types, setting styles, treatments + labels, colour intensities, clarities + labels) — idempotent.
3. **Domain package (pure, zero runtime deps):** enums, value objects (Money, WeightCt, DimensionsMm, SourceSku/DerivedSku, ConfigurationHash), SKU grammar parser + composer, configuration hash + base62 slug, compatibility engine, pricing calculator, order state machine. All unit-tested.
